3. source_indicators/  (third-party code, not licensed by the authors of this repository)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The five files in `source_indicators/` are the unmodified published code of their original authors, included for
provenance. Each remains under its author's own terms, stated in the file's header:
  - Machine Learning: Lorentzian Classification, by jdehorty: Mozilla Public License 2.0
  - Nadaraya-Watson Trend [QuantAlgo], by QuantAlgo: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0
  - Indicator: WaveTrend Oscillator [WT], by LazyBear: no licence stated; open-source under TradingView House Rules
  - Weis Wave Volume, by modhelius: no licence stated; open-source under TradingView House Rules
  - Squeeze Momentum Indicator [LazyBear], by LazyBear: no licence stated; open-source under TradingView House Rules
TradingView script publishing rules (the "House Rules" that the script pages refer to for reuse of open-source code):
  https://www.tradingview.com/support/solutions/43000590599/

