4. Market data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

`backtest/data/BTCUSDT_1h.csv` (Binance) and `backtest/multimarket/data/BTCUSD_1D.csv` (Bitstamp) are third-party
market data, included only so that the study can be reproduced. They are not licensed by the authors and remain
subject to the data providers' terms. Yahoo Finance data is not included (see README.md section 7).

